+# F-31: Tend UI Pagination
+
+## Result
+
+Status: `[x] complete`
+
+Task-list pagination now renders through Tend UI `Pagination` while S-Tracker retains page state and task slicing.
+
+## Ownership Contract
+
+React owns only the visible pagination control and request emission.
+
+Vanilla code remains authoritative:
+
+1. `paginateItems()` calculates the page count and visible task slice.
+2. `renderPaginationControls()` publishes confirmed `current`, `pageSize`, `total` and `totalPages`.
+3. React renders Tend UI Pagination and emits `s-tracker:page-request`.
+4. Vanilla code validates the requested page.
+5. Vanilla code updates `window.paginationState.current` and calls `renderTab(tabName, true)`.
+6. The confirmed rerender publishes the resulting state back to React.
+
+The adapter contains no task data, queue logic, filters, selected-task state or direct `renderTab` call.
+
+## Public Package Export
+
+```text
+@10d/tend-ui/primitives/Pagination
+```
+
+The narrow export provides ESM, CJS and types from the refreshed local tarball.
+
+## Preserved Product Contract
+
+| Scenario | Verified result |
+| --- | --- |
+| More than 20 tasks | Pagination visible |
+| 20 or fewer tasks | Pagination hidden |
+| Initial/current reset | Page 1 |
+| Direct page selection | Correct 20-task slice |
+| Previous/next | Moves by one page |
+| First/last edge | Corresponding arrow disabled |
+| Last page | Partial result preserved |
+| Queue or search change | Resets to page 1 |
+| Card/table mode change | Current page preserved |
+| Selected tasks | Preserved across pages |
+| Active bulk-action bar | Pagination moves above it and remains clickable |
+
